<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
    <title>{{branding.domain}} - Sign In or Create Account</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/core/fonts.css?v={{css_version}}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-bundle.css?v={{css_version}}">
</head>
<body class="auth-light">
    <main class="auth-page">
        <div class="auth-info">
            <div>
                <div class="auth-badge">Astound Digital &middot; Internal AI Platform</div>
                <h2>Welcome</h2>
                <p>
                    This is Astound Digital's internal AI platform. Sign in with your work
                    email and a passkey. No passwords are created or stored. Salesforce can
                    be connected later from your profile.
                </p>

                <details class="auth-more">
                <summary>How sign-in works, recovery, and enterprise options</summary>
                <hr class="auth-divider">

                <h2>Getting Started</h2>
                <div class="auth-flow-steps">
                    <div class="auth-flow-step"><span class="step-num">1</span><span>Create an account with your Astound work email and a passkey</span></div>
                    <div class="auth-flow-step"><span class="step-num">2</span><span>Download the desktop bridge for <a href="/files/downloads/astound-bridge-macos.dmg">Mac</a>, <a href="/files/downloads/astound-bridge-windows.exe">Windows</a>, or <a href="/files/downloads/astound-bridge-linux-x86_64.tar.gz">Linux</a></span></div>
                    <div class="auth-flow-step"><span class="step-num">3</span><span>Approve the device link &mdash; the bridge installs your Cowork profile and syncs your skills</span></div>
                    <div class="auth-flow-step"><span class="step-num">4</span><span>Use Astound skills and your own Salesforce data directly inside your AI tools</span></div>
                </div>

                <hr class="auth-divider">

                <h2>How Sign-In Works</h2>
                <p>Email registration is limited to allow-listed work-email domains. Instead
                    of a password you create a passkey &mdash; Touch&nbsp;ID, Windows&nbsp;Hello, or your
                    phone &mdash; and sign in with it from then on. You can connect your Salesforce
                    account afterwards from your profile page, but it is optional.</p>

                <hr class="auth-divider">

                <h2>Trouble Signing In?</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have lost access to your passkey, contact the platform team for a
                    new setup link.
                </p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-form-col">
            <div class="login-container login-container--bare">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="login-logo">
                        <img src="/files/images/logo.svg" alt="{{branding.domain}}" height="40" class="logo-light">
                        <img src="/files/images/logo-white.svg" alt="{{branding.domain}}" height="40" class="logo-dark">
                    </div>

                    <!-- ids consumed by webauthn-login.js -->
                    <div id="pane-signin">
                        <p class="login-subtitle">Sign in</p>

                        <div id="error" class="login-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>

                        <div id="login-form">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="login-email">Email</label>
                                <input class="form-input" type="email" id="login-email" placeholder="you@astounddigital.com" required autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="error">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-actions">
                                <button type="button" id="sign-in-btn" class="btn btn-primary w-full">Sign in with Passkey</button>
                            </div>
                            {{#if self_registration_open}}
                            <p class="login-switch">New here? <a href="#" id="show-register">Create an account</a></p>
                            {{else}}
                            <p class="login-switch">New here? Ask an administrator for an invite link.</p>
                            {{/if}}
                        </div>

                        {{#if self_registration_open}}
                        <div id="register-form" hidden>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="register-email">Work email</label>
                                <input class="form-input" type="email" id="register-email" placeholder="you@astounddigital.com" required autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="error">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="register-name">Name</label>
                                <input class="form-input" type="text" id="register-name" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-actions">
                                <button type="button" id="register-btn" class="btn btn-primary w-full">Create account with Passkey</button>
                            </div>
                            <p class="login-switch">Already registered? <a href="#" id="show-signin">Sign in</a></p>
                        </div>
                        {{/if}}

                        <div id="loading" class="login-loading" hidden aria-live="polite">
                            <div class="login-spinner" role="status" aria-label="Loading"></div>
                            <p id="loading-text">Processing...</p>
                        </div>

                        <div id="retry" class="login-retry">
                            <a href="/admin/login">Try again</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script data-cfasync="false" src="/js/pages/admin-login.js?v={{css_version}}" type="module"></script>

    <script data-cfasync="false" src="/js/services/webauthn-login.js?v=4" type="module"></script>
    <script data-cfasync="false" src="/js/services/webauthn-register.js?v=1" type="module"></script>
</body>
</html>
